<description>&lt;p&gt;Djibouti peacekeepers were killed in a clash with Hawadle militias at Beledweyne airport while Djibouti forces also repelled an attack near the same airport. U.S. airstrikes hit al-Shabab positions in three locations across Somalia following a probing attack on Mangai Camp in Lamu. A probe found that the United Arab Emirates turned civilian airfields in Somaliland and Puntland into military bases. A Somali-American Uber driver was assaulted in Minnesota after political rhetoric, prompting a community rally for the victim's family. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPdmF5V2FxNUNfQ1N4Z2RMRU1xYWYxUklnbjZEck5XQWlGRHhCTjdycFhVTExjSHFCVGhzdzlNTTFONUpKSFE5ZXdVdTBaX2R5OUdTME9fQ1AyWVpsaW9aLWxIcGg3SW9DRDlWVkw2QjFUbzF1ZEFmTjEzMmxka0NhUm15SGU4RVhJS1B4TFYxSTZqZGlUWVdFSHdaSDhhZVE2c2lzODRnTmktY3hnTVpHS2U4c2loNFhTb3BveVRYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNSlZUZUxmNkI1RUdmOXNTWGVMMjhVNURWdWRCd2swTGR6eVRGQjU3ckdpLVFxRnZ0V29jV2RnY1pNWklQUXFvU010OVdobHdwQXE2Yy1IbzVyTDNxaUROVmFTUjV0NkxoYkJvOEZLSFBGQUJpeWRocF83Vk8yTXJKWUMwUlVsd0FUeXNOZy1sU3lNZDR2R0VEVDFHX0hpOWZ4dVdFN3djVC1EdEwtb2ZEX3p4cGhacnFReTIzdWFVSFVyQ00?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPTFlmMXJrYVlJTVRpS0hTX3VETXRWc0tHVmNJZWwwa0lKTkthVUx5U0pTeG9hdVpmeEtVVFlmWXQtN3Z5NC1RcWJCRzhhRkg1RjZ5NHcyM3ZzZVQ3V3hpemFXWXNZMk9OVmllVG90ZHpJNEtXRUYxNjQzTUdVTkktcFItWFlGbVVGc19nTGFlMzlpNWp0eUh2Y0RyN3c1TWotOHN4M1EzVjNLU1g5bEpLSEFQc0VFTHNoWnQxMDZNSWlMQkFkZzJ6RTJwOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPS0haTVlfaWhERG9aS3VqX1RVeldBa05MalhGa1dUazZLSzVtOGRQOXlzcER